// Package oprowswire is the sprint store's operation rows as fixed and variable
// tables, generated by the pinned schema compiler from schemas/oprows/oprows.schema:
// the operation journal record, the held lock, the notes and note lines, the timers,
// the cells and moved members of a change event, the engine's request digest and
// step result and the teardown member list. Every other .go file here is generated:
// never edit them; edit the schema and run go generate ./internal/sprint/store/oprowswire.
// The compiler is pinned by exact commit (mas-bandwidth/schema 54e0eda7d20b,
// sprint/schema-go on 2026-10-17); go run fetches it, so generating needs the network and the build does not.
package oprowswire

//go:generate go run github.com/mas-bandwidth/schema/v2/cmd/schema@v2.5.1-0.20261017153557-54e0eda7d20b generate --lang go --out . ../../../../schemas/oprows
